==Russian==

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ru|orv|сука}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*sùka}}, further etymology unclear. Possibly from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*ḱwṓ}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ru-IPA|су́ка}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-сука.ogg}}

====Noun====
