# [[bitch]] {{gl|female dog}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|offensive}} [[bitch]] {{gl|contemptible person, usually but not necessarily female}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|offensive}} frivolous, promiscuous female
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|offensive|slang}} sometimes used to denote any female
# {{lb|ru|prison slang}} snitch, inmate who collaborates with prison administration

